  <para style="h">2 Atasaloniyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Atasaloniyi Baayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Atasaloniyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ata</para>
  <para style="mt1">Atasaloniyi Baayi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Bwulus, Sila n Timotii.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2TH 1:1">Kwoi lo da Atasaloniyi Ikilisiya, dna n Shekwoyi əyi Dada n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa ɓe da fye, n ɓa kwnu n Shekwoyi əyi Dada aba ɓədo n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amisaga n aduwazhnii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Yi kwnuce lo ya sa Shekwoyi ami ciici ntu əfye ɓo, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, ntuge kwo bmyalo lonu, shikwonyi əfye gaiciyaganunui gnyilo kwoi mwa n gnaɓeɓe, jesnu yeye n əfye vnyanya ncei lo ga aje nyi, kwo lo kwoi ɓeɓe nu. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ntulonu, n Shekwoyi aikilisiya atasni, yi gyigbe lo ntu əfye bwugbashni ɓo n gaiciyaganunui fyi n əfye awyesnugbegye sni vnyanya ɓədo n amwimwii n fye ɓwamì n ɓai nyi.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Dəye vnyanya wulo pəipəi nge Shekwoyi owada wulo ceewo, ntucenu a ɓa ba fye fyi ge fye kwnuce lo n Shekwoyi əbemii, n fye zhi fyei gye əkwo azhnì nyi. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Shekwoyi zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu: Wo ɓə gba aza azhnì əta n azhnìi n ɓa ɓə kpe fye azhnì nyi <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />jesnu woi ga fye snusnu n a kpe fye azhnì nyi, n əyii ɓədo ce. Dəye ɓə zhni she Dagayi Yeisu ɓə kpeyaɓe woi gbmi n əshemi dna n əná gwogwoyi n əwo amaləka akaladai. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Wo ɓə ta aza yi n ɓa ta kpe Shekwoyi əye lo m, jesnu to ɓai vyi ɓəgbetu nabagyi manai əyi Dagayi Yeisu nya m. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />A ɓə ta ɓa n agbmazhni nyalonyalo nyai, jesnu ai kwu ɓa gwuaba zhi n əbmyi n Dagayi awyeba, n ikwo duduyi əwo latu nyai. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ń nyipyei n wo ɓə ɓe, ai la wo tu dna n əwo aza gyigyiyi atasni jesnu cei wo aza yi vnyanya n ɓa kwu gaiciyaga nyi. A n fyei ba fyilo ntuge fye ɓə kwu gaiciyaga n əyi ɓəgbmi ga fye.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />N dəyei dna n mi, yi zhniaduwa lo cici ga fye, nge əyi Shekwoyi wo zhni fye fya kwu kwnuce n əwo yiyii. Njesnu, nge ǹ əwo ikwoi wo ɓa nu pwawo manai dəhodəhoi ga fye n tnutnu dəhodəhoi n kwo pá n əfye gaiciyaga nyi. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Yi zhniaduwa ye nabai n əyi Dagayi Yeisu əye ɓa ɓwa latu dna əfye, əfyehni ce dna n əwo, ngye shi kwo vyi shebmyashi əyi Shekwoyi n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Əza tna-owaɓwashiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ntu əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓeɓe ɓo jesnu n əyi yezhii n wo aba, yi gna fye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />fye to kwu pye n ashnashnai, kwo fya vnyi ntu nyawu ɓo n a gna kwo kwnu n yi aba nu, kwo n sheɓəgwognai, kwo n ɓədagbmai n gbeɓwo, kwo n pakai; n kwo gyitu lo nge Dagayi nyipyei kwo la luɓe m. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Fye to ye zahozahoyi wa dna fye kwoce kwo fyewyi, n zokwo dəhodəhoi m. Ntuge nyipyei yii taa ɓe m, akpəge a kwu tukwognanakwo ɓo zhni jesnu a la əza tna-owaɓwashiyi kpeyawu, əza n a woi znuknyi shi ntu agbmazhni ɓo nyi. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Wo ɓə gnyiapaapa jesnu wo ɓə la əwohni latu n du nyahonyahoi n a yi nge Shekwoyi, kwo n a ga kwo mwamwa, nabai woi la əwohni dna n Shekwoyi pwuwa, woi dnawyi nge əwo nu zhni Shekwoyi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Fye ta pá lo nge, əsa n mi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei nyi, mi ɓə zhni mii gna fye aɓo ye m? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Nsaiye fye kpe ənya əye lo n kwo ye n woi wnashi, nabai n əwo kpeyawu ɓə ɓe n əsai bmyabmya. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ntuge ikwo fyaafyaai tna-owaɓwashiyi nya gnyilo kwoi lo tnutnu; ama əza n wo n kwoi wnashi gnyi nsaiye nyi, wo ɓa gwodu wa shi kwo ɓwa nya əsa n a ɓə la kwo gbmiya n zokwo. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Nsayii nu ń a ɓə kpé tna-owaɓwashiyi ya wu, əza n Dagayi Yeisu ɓə shni wo ya n əbe n əsnu əwo əgbe nyai, woi zhni wo agbma n əwyii n wo ɓə jezeɓe nyi. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Tna-owaɓwashiyi ɓeɓe ɓə vyi shi Shetam zhni atnutnu nu. Wo ɓə zhniapma n azokwoi gbowogbowo woi wu akalá dna n aznù jesnu n aɓoawowoi akatá nyai, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />jesnu n azokwoi vnyanya n əkpízhnizhni dna aza kwoce ncei ɓa kwu ɓwu nyi. Ɓa ɓə ɓwu ntuge ɓa ɓə ná yeye aɓo nu n gaiciyanunui n kwo ɓə ɓa gnyi ɓa nyi. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ntu dəye ɓo, Shekwoyi wa tnu ɓa n bwugbaajegbmi kaladai nabai n ɓa ɓa ga akatá gaiciya <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />ntulonu a ɓə kwu aza vnyanya znuknyi n ɓa to ɓə gwo gaiciyanunui m, ama ɓa kwu dagbma fyi n əkpizhni.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fye kwu myizhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ama yi gwo ya sa Shekwoyi ami ciici ntu əfye ɓo, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai Dagayi aza ayeyei, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓə knyí fye ngye gyigyi kpmisnuyi nu, fya ɓwa gnyignyi dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi tnutnu pmyapmya nya, jesnu dna n gaiciyanunui gwogwo. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Wo ɓə yi fye ɓe ncei dna n əyi nabagyi manai ye nu, nabai n fye ɓa myi fya kwnu latu əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya gwo.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ntulonu, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye kwu myizhi dəidəi jesnu fya kwu nyawu shiɓwa n yi kwu kwo fyi fye n akwnu nyi, kwo n ɓədagbma gbeɓwo nyai kwo n pakai nu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Fa əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti n əwohni tukwoi n Shekwoyi əyi Dadai, n wo ɓə ye yi jesnu dna n əwo shebmyashi wa ga yi agwumyi nyalonyalo nya n awyetu manai nyi, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />ɓa myi fye adu zhi jesnu ɓa fyi fye akalá dna n aɓo manaizhnii dəhodəhoi ɓədo n ɓədagbmai.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Wyegyi ntu n aduwazhni ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ntu n aɓoaje ɓo, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye zhniaduwa ga yi nabai n Dagayi ɓədatnu ɓa gnamyi n pyeepye jesnu a ga kwo mwamwa ngye shi kwo ɓə ɓwasnu n əfye aba nyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Njesnu fya zhniaduwa nge n a ɓa gnyi yi ya n akpizhniyi akwnu n aza nukwoii, ntuge zahozahoyi nu to n gaiciyaganunuii lo m. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ama Dagayi zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu, wo ɓa fyi fye akalá jesnu wa kna fye n əzanukwoyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Yi n agwumyii lo dna n Dagayi, nge fye zhni aɓo lo n yi ɓə tu fye əgbe nyi, jesnu fye ɓə ye gwodu fya zhni ɓa. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Fa Dagayi wa ga fye awyega n əfya adu dna n Shekwoyi yeye n Kirisiti əmìfyi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù ntu ɓwato ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Dna n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti əye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, yi tu fye ɓəgbe, fye la kpmiya n vyiyi dəhodəhoi n wo wo ɓwato lo, to woi ye wa zhni tnutnu m, jesnu n wo ta gyianyì lo n vyi nyawu n fye ɓə gwo n yi nyi m. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ntuge əfyehni fye kpəlo shi fye gwo fya vyi əyi əfye. Yi to ɓə zhni yii wo ɓwato, əsa n yi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei nyi m, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />kwo ya gyi əzaho nyagyi, to ya gba kwo əta m. N əkwoɓwi, yi ɓə zhni tnutnu n əyi aɓwai nu, nyipyei n sukwoi n əyihnii kwukwui, to yii snu m, nabai n yi taa kwu zè akaya tu əzaho n əfye m. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Yi ɓə zhni lonu, toge yi to ɓə kwnuce nu ya gwo bmazhni m, ama ya kwu zè ofye n fye ɓa vyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Kwo əsa n yi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei nyi, yi ɓə la ɓəgbetu ye ga fye: “Əza n wo taa ye wa zhni tnutnu m, wo taa gyi nyagyi m.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Yi wo lo nge azaho lo n əfye n ɓa zhni aɓwatoyi nu, ɓai wnu azaje tnutnuzhni ya. Ɓa ta zhni tnutnu ho lo m, ɓa zhni aɓəshnayi nu. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Aza yi pya nu n yi tu ɓa əgbe jesnu yi tnaɓwa nu dna n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti, nge ɓa kwu wnazhi jesnu ɓa ɓwa nyagyi n kwo gbmi n əɓa tnutnu ɓa gyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ama əfyeeda, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, a to kwu fye ɓe n aɓo manaizhnii m.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Fye la əwyewna n zahozahoyii n wo ta vyi əyi gbega lo n kwo fyi n paka ye nyi m. Fye to dna əɓwado n woi m, nabai vnyinkwo kwa wo wo. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Dudulonu fye to kwu ɓa zè anuwnuyi m, ama fye gnaknyi ɓa shi fye ɓa gnaknyi vyiyi ədo nyi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gnaɓyi kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nsaiye, fa Dagayi bwugbafu nya n əwohni tukwoi wa ga fye bwugbafu nsahosahoi jesnu dna n zokwo dəhodəhoi. Dagayi wo kwnusnu n fyei vnyanya.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Əmi Bwulus nu na ka gnaɓyi ye n əmihni aɓwai, n əkwo nu wu əznù kakai n əmi apaka vnyanya. Mi kanya n wu nlai nu.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Shebmyashi əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya kwo kwnusnu n fyei vnyanya.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>